  "claim": "Caged No More is a 2016 American drama film directed by Lisa Arnold, the film stars the American actress and singer Loretta Devine, (born August 21, 1949) , is best known for her roles as Marla Hendricks, in the Paramount Pictures drama series, \"Boston Public\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Caged No More. Sentence: The film stars Kevin Sorbo, Loretta Devine, Cynthia Gibb, Madison De La Garza, Cassidy Gifford and Dallas Lovato.\nPage: Loretta Devine. Sentence: Loretta Devine (born August 21, 1949) is an American actress and singer, best known for her roles as Marla Hendricks in the Fox drama series \"Boston Public\", and for her recurring role as Adele Webber on the Shonda Rhimes' \"Grey's Anatomy\", for which she won a Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Guest Actress in a Drama Series in 2011.",
